m ResolutionSelector (width/height). Default is 1 megapixel (1024*1024). For native 2K, set 1:1 and 4 megapixels (2048*2048). Prefer multiples of 32.\n\n## Transparent Image\n\nTo generate a transparent image, wrap the prompt like this and replace the middle with the subject:\n\n---\nThis is an RGBA format image with transparency. `[your description]`. The image has an alpha channel and a transparent background.\n\n---\nSave as PNG to keep the alpha channel.\n\n## Parameters\n\n- prompt: what to generate. For RGBA, see Note: transparent.\n- negative_prompt: unused while cfg is 1.\n- cfg: keep 1 for the Qwen Image 2.1 official path. Raise it only if you use a negative prompt.\n- steps: Qwen Image 2.1 official  pipeline uses about 40-50 with euler. This template starts at 25. More advanced samplers need fewer steps.\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Usage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [420, 220], "pos": [862.698486328125, 2306.83544921875], "id": 468, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [677], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "links": [679], "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "negative"}, {"name": "latent", "label": "latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent"}], "size": [530, 680], "pos": [2020, 2270], "widgets_values": ["国庆长假商业主视觉 KV，超现实微缩旅行世界，融合年轻化 3D 广告视觉。画面中央偏右，斜向打开一台巨型笔记本电脑，机身采用亮红色磨砂塑料材质，搭配亮银色金属边框、金属锁扣，机身环绕流动的数据光轨；电脑显示屏内部是一座立体微缩景观，囊括高山、澄澈湖泊、滨海海岸、蜿蜒公路、城市建筑群，画面点缀临街商铺门店、城市天际线与湖畔露营地。一条高亮暖橙色公路，从屏幕景观深处蜿蜒涌出，横穿画面中心一直延伸至镜头跟前；数辆越野跑车在公路上疾驰，前景车轮与道路标识局部冲出画框，增强突破感。\n混合超广角航拍 + 低机位仰拍视角，营造夸张的空间折叠效果，远景锐利清晰，前景物体体量巨大。淡蓝色天空悬浮半透明导航光轨、弧形流线轨迹，点缀少量彩色艺术气球装置。\n整体配色：晴空蓝、深墨绿、暖橙为主，局部点缀中国红，国际化高端商业质感。Octane 渲染，64K 超高清，极致细节，电影级光影。画面左侧添加流动手绘粗体字：“Runninghub-qwen_image_2.1_t2i”，文字带肌理质感，艺术抽象，诗意氛围，高级克制，大师级配色与排版，构图均衡协调，视觉冲击力极强，获奖广告作品，大师杰作。", "", 1024], "inputs": [{"name": "clip"